{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/202663IHXYFIMU1794199752.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產西南區香港仔大道分行副分區營業經理郭詠媚表示，分行新近促成香港仔居屋嘉隆苑買賣成交，單位為嘉平閣（B座）低層4室，實用面積554平方呎，屬2房間隔，向東，最新以綠表價435萬元成交，折合實用呎價7,852元。</p><p><br/>據了解，原業主於1991年以75.4萬元一手購入單位，持貨35年，是次轉手賬面獲利359.6萬元，單位升值4.8倍。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T13:00:47.758730+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":167,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T07:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T22:01:11.974172+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:54:18.743014+00:00","content_hash":"f2e0f24f49e72b4589b9b718dce0cc541d1831a3cea7877fb20131ca7c852d23","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T13:00:47.758730+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}